  "beats": [
    {
      "start": 0,
      "end": 3.664423999999999,
      "narration_en": "How do you stop a jet doing a hundred fifty miles an hour?",
      "source_audio_sha256": "9502264e02b7bba204a20919eca1dac07df7015e381143af62e6c595388b4780"
    },
    {
      "start": 3.664423999999999,
      "end": 7.349430999999998,
      "narration_en": "The deck is far too short to brake, so the jet drops a hook.",
      "source_audio_sha256": "3b49241eb57a91505eb11fe89bc009849ff33ddf2ab9606ed31f154813c08d05"
    },
    {
      "start": 7.349430999999998,
      "end": 10.941437999999998,
      "narration_en": "It snags one of four steel cables stretched across the deck.",
      "source_audio_sha256": "e0027ff821528c571e386b25f94c23c2c9528f60d8cab26b692ab83bf7baade7"
    },
    {
      "start": 10.941437999999998,
      "end": 15.686506999999997,
      "narration_en": "Below deck, the cable runs around pulleys to a giant hydraulic piston.",
      "source_audio_sha256": "fc191bf75585925cecbe2e7f7e0a26758fe6d6dd6c22431ca4c3a3dba68eff42"
    },
    {
      "start": 15.686506999999997,
      "end": 22.059971999999995,
      "narration_en": "As the jet drags the cable out, the piston forces oil through a valve, turning speed into heat.",
      "source_audio_sha256": "eec1aa1e2ef62081a80cb6b0962a07ff943ce3b737805129e123b2d211dd8b3c"
    },
    {
      "start": 22.059971999999995,
      "end": 25.941978999999993,
      "narration_en": "It stops a fifty-thousand-pound jet in about the length of a football field.",
      "source_audio_sha256": "100ea7c45ce5f1c32e08b977e2e53452347d105b7b55ac2e28195e41c89a1fcf"
    },
    {
      "start": 25.941978999999993,
      "end": 29.034985999999993,
      "narration_en": "The pilot hits full throttle anyway, in case the hook misses.",
      "source_audio_sha256": "71ecec8d7c4bc8ebbe842c31c4155a78d1ab2db78e485095f8b95c4d8219241b"
    },
    {
      "start": 29.034985999999993,
      "end": 30.97799299999999,
      "narration_en": "That's me in the cockpit, by the way.",
      "source_audio_sha256": "05e7373f40144db59249342860ff323bca067fd8b81e700d54896c0e10d2eeaf"
    },
    {
      "start": 30.97799299999999,
      "end": 34.976,
      "narration_en": "And after a hundred twenty-five landings, the cable gets thrown away.",
      "source_audio_sha256": "a8832c45dea28d9f30b434dfbe4843b70bd5e61aafa92f6239545b0f99335bcd"
    }
  ],
